I've handed issue #27 to the mechanic subagent, which is running in the background. I don't have any results yet.

The brief tells it to:
- find and fix the zero-padding bug in `bin/pad`;
- follow `docs/CONTRIBUTING.md`: `# last-fixed: PAD-9` on line 2 of the script, a final `PAD-9 | pad | <summary>` line in `CHANGES.txt`, and a passing `bash tools/check.sh`;
- open the PR with `gh pr create --base staging --title "PAD-9: <summary>"`.

I'll report back when it finishes, including the PR link.

